2. Overall Description
2.1 Product Perspective
The system is a new, self-contained product. It replaces separate departmental equipment lists with one shared record. The prototype uses React + Vite, FastAPI and PostgreSQL (confirmed in Phase 2), with the five AI features behind one AI service layer that calls the Gemini API. The core workflow must keep working when the AI service is down.
