5.5 Business Rules
ID	Rule
BR-1	An asset belongs to exactly one department and has exactly one custodian at any time.
BR-2	No asset may change department without an Approved request and a confirmed receipt.
BR-3	A user may not approve their own request.
BR-4	Only the owning department's representative (or an administrator) approves a transfer of that department's asset.
BR-5	Donation, recycling and disposal require sustainability-officer approval; disposal is the last option after reuse, repair, donation and recycling are ruled out.
BR-6	AI output is advisory only; the approving user is accountable for the decision.
BR-7	A reservation holds an asset for at most 3 working days without a decision.
BR-8	Final-state assets (Donated, Recycled, Disposed) cannot be reactivated.
BR-9	Before a purchase request is raised, procurement shall check the marketplace for a match (supported by FR-AI-4).
